---
title: "handle_mint (Pebble Protocol: Market Internal)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_amount: assert coin.value() != 0
    q_check_amount --> q_load_asset: asset = assets.load_mut_by_type(name)
    q_load_asset --> q_check_paused: assert !deposit_paused
    q_check_paused --> q_get_config: asset_config = asset.asset_config()
    q_get_config --> q_accrue: accrue_interest(name, reserves, config, model, now)
    q_accrue --> q_check_limit: assert !deposit_limit_breached(deposit_amount, max_deposit_amount)
    q_check_limit --> q_mint: ctoken = reserve.mint_ctokens(coin)
    q_mint --> q_load_obligation: obligation = obligations.borrow_mut(obligation_id)
    q_load_obligation --> q_check_market: assert obligation.market_id() == self.id
    q_check_market --> q_deposit_ctoken: obligation.deposit_ctoken(ctoken)
    q_deposit_ctoken --> q_rate_limit: emode.deposit_limiter.reduce_outflow(now, deposit_amount)
    q_rate_limit --> [*]: return (ctoken_amount, total_ctoken_amount)

    note right of q_mint
        INV-001: exchange_rate = cash_plus_borrows_minus_reserves / total_supply
        INV-002: mint_amount = collateral_amount / exchange_rate
        INV-003: cash increases by deposit amount
        INV-004: total_supply increases by mint_amount
    end note

    note right of q_deposit_ctoken
        INV-005: cannot deposit ctoken if same CoinType is borrowed
        INV-006: ctoken balance joined to obligation
    end note
